OL,3,GNEWSAJudge to rule on Orangeman's
OL,4,Achallenge of Drumcree march ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudgment is due to be delivered later
OL,7,Fin a High Court bid to overturn the
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,9,FBryant's decision to ban the Drumcree
OL,10,Fparade.
OL,12,FThe legal challenge was brought by a
OL,13,FPortadown Orangeman against Sir Chris
OL,14,Fand the Police Service of Northern
OL,15,FIreland (PSNI) Chief Constable Jon
OL,16,FBoutcher.
OL,18,FSir Chris's intervention to stop the
OL,19,Fparade came after he received security
OL,20,Fadvice from Boutcher.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
